    "body": "## Description\n\n- Add `@yulangz` as a code owner for the nine requested core and v2 modules.\n- Assign `/areal/reward/prm/` exclusively to `@dingzhiqiang` and `@fishcrap`.\n- Add `@daihaowz` for `/areal/api/`, `/areal/infra/`, and `/areal/trainer/` while retaining their existing owners.\n- Remove `@rchardx` and `@nuzant` from all CODEOWNERS rules, including documentation and `.github`.\n\n## Related Issue\n\nNone specified.\n\n## Type of Change\n\nGovernance / maintainer ownership update.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] I have read the [Contributing Guide](https://github.com/areal-project/community/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks pass (`pre-commit run --all-files`)\n- [ ] Relevant tests pass; new tests added for new functionality\n- [ ] Documentation updated (if applicable; built with `./docs/build_all.sh`)\n- [x] Branch is up to date with `main`\n- [ ] Self-reviewed via `/review-pr` command\n- [x] This PR was created by a coding agent via `/create-pr`\n- [ ] This PR is a breaking change\n\n## Additional Context\n\nValidation:\n- `pre-commit run --files .github/CODEOWNERS` passed.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` passed.\n- A CODEOWNERS rule check confirmed `@yulangz` in exactly the nine requested module rules and no `@rchardx` or `@nuzant` in any rule.\n- A PRM rule check confirmed `@dingzhiqiang` and `@fishcrap` are its only owners.\n- A rule check confirmed `@daihaowz` appears only in the three requested modules.\n- `pre-commit run --all-files` was run, but returned nonzero because hooks regenerated unrelated lockfiles. Those generated changes were reverted before committing.\n\nNo runtime tests were run because this changes reviewer ownership only.\n",
